New in version 1.33: 
*If your connection to the server timmed out, The game attempts to restart automaticly. 
*Updated the registration system!: So now you can make your own account, But it should not contain any spaces like dashes and underlines. Also your name should be in english language to be understandable for everyone!.
*Now the newbies can't enter to the baddle fields map. Also they can't spawn robots!. 
*Now the mines can't hurt the newbies. For that, the newbies can't spawn mines. Sorry newbies for that. 
